@page "/aspectratio"

<PageTitle>AspectRatio</PageTitle>

<h3>Aspect ratio</h3>
<p>
    The AspectRatio is a <span class="token property">double</span> that defines the ratio between the width and height of the chart.
    When this ratio is equal to <span class="font-monospace">1.0</span> the chart occupies a square area;
    if it is lower, it is taller than it is wide, and if it is higher, it extends more horizontally.<br />
    The permitted ratios are all those between
    <span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Minimum))</span> (<span class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Minimum.ToString("0.0")</span>) and
    <span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Maximum))</span> (<span class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Maximum.ToString("0.0")</span>).
</p>
<p>
    <div class="card overflow-hidden">
        <div class="card-body overflow-auto">
            <table class="table text-nowrap align-middle mb-0 border">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>AspectRatio</th>
                        <th>Value</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Square))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Square.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Higher))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Higher.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Vertical))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Vertical.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Portrait))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Portrait.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Standard))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Standard.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Photo))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Photo.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Widescreen))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Widescreen.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Panoramic))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Panoramic.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Ultrawide))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Ultrawide.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Extralarge))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Extralarge.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Minimum))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Minimum.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="token keyword font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios))</span>.<span class="font-monospace">@(nameof(AspectRatios.Maximum))</span></td>
                        <td class="font-monospace">@AspectRatios.Maximum.ToString("0.0#")</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</p>
<p>
    <b>NB:</b> The aspect ratio can only be edited for <b>Cartesian</b> and <b>Barcharts</b>,
    so it excludes circular charts and gauges, which already have their own specific geometry.
</p>
